OL,3,GNEWSABacklog of 4,000 population
OL,4,Apermits 'sobering'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA politician has called new figures
OL,7,Fshowing there are thousands of
OL,8,Fpopulation management applications
OL,9,Fwaiting to be dealt with as "very
OL,10,Fsobering reading".
OL,12,FThe Committee for Home Affairs said
OL,13,Fthat as of 17 September, 3,886
OL,14,Fpopulation management applications were
OL,15,Foutstanding, alongside 324 applications
OL,16,Fwithin immigration workstreams.
OL,18,FCommittee president Deputy Marc
OL,19,FLeadbeater said additional resources
OL,20,Fwere now "essential" if the States of
OL,21,FGuernsey wants to make progress in
OL,22,Ftackling the delays.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
