OL,3,GNEWSABacklog of 4,000 population
OL,4,Apermits 'sobering'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNo timeframe has been given for when
OL,7,Fthe backlog could be cleared, with work
OL,8,Fstill under way to establish targets.
